# 04_executive_meeting_brief.doom
# Extracts key takeaways, generates slide deck and executive KPI callout.

domain office

set raw_transcript to "Quarterly Board Meeting Notes: Revenue reached record highs with 24% YoY growth. Key engineering infrastructure milestones completed on schedule. Expansion into European cloud regions approved by directors for Q1 rollout."

extract executive summary from raw_transcript into 4 bullet points into takeaways
render metric callout with label "Annual Growth", value "+24%", delta "YoY" into kpi_card
compile markdown presentation to slides with theme "Executive Dark" into pitch_deck

say "=== EXECUTIVE SUMMARY BRIEF ==="
for each takeaway in takeaways:
    say takeaway

say "KPI Callout: " + kpi_card's label + " = " + kpi_card's value
say "Slide Presentation Status: " + pitch_deck's status
